# 本仓库为纯 Windows 项目，且构建流程含字节级校验（文档 SHA-256、包体清单）。
# 因此不做激进的换行归一化：交给 core.autocrlf 决定，保持与本地一致。
* text=auto

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.zip binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
